  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"上传优惠券的券码，调用此接口前，需要先创建卡券，获取优惠券id，优惠券的券码类型需要为商家上传券码类型。\",\"id\":\"clue.coupon.code.upload\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/clue/coupon/code/upload/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710638086159\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"clue.coupon.create\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要先创建卡券才能上传券码\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"创建卡券\"},{\"id\":\"clue.coupon.get\",\"path\":\"\",\"reason\":\"需要调用卡券详情接口获取优惠券ID\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取卡券详情\"},{\"id\":\"get.access.token\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506574848\",\"reason\":\"需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710638086159\",\"title\":\"上传券码\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7wPE4SJd\">通过此接口，你可以上传优惠券的券码。调用此接口前，需要先创建卡券，获取优惠券id，优惠券的券码类型需要为商家上传券码类型。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201772941995239431%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-GOglpHha\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-FYgXYNUv\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/coupon/code/upload/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/clue/coupon/code/upload/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710638086159\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-3ll1Hj6N\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-VHnxqzUI\">POST</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-nRDuYXJ8\" id=\"link-2\">Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-IRCC59gL\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-I1XJUtFM\"><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-Pbp1Z0U3\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-vmFnBVuW\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"cd11d5e0-3560TITN\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333