; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MxzmpP5Q\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-83EyReoo\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-B22NavdY\">客户ID</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-reIXgxkt\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-CDvHLcGz\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HDKaTV37\">file <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22BdGd5%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-ZSuk9iRz\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zpUduj83\">file</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-moZ5LqEc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-l5DdNtLv\">券码文件<br/>建议txt格式，券码数量不超过100万，否则可能解析失败。<br/>每行一个券码，券码格式4-30位，字母+数字</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-h7ZfXRAi\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-mX39Rgqn\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WyC5Jfla\">mark <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22ymB1E%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-KFfNNRn6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4l8WPBWA\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-SC9SGDDy\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-C8NOoqZM\">本次上传的标识<br/>任意字符串，建议每次不一样，会在response中透传回来</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-niujOtq4\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-yMvQtYRu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LwrrvTiT\">resource_id <span class=\"qz-tag-view qz-tag-type-must\" data-type=\"tag\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22tagType%22%3A%22must%22%2C%22tagValue%22%3A%22%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%22%2C%22isCustom%22%3Afalse%2C%22id%22%3A%22lBtz1%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\" style=\"color:#338aff;background:#ebf3ff;\">必填</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-2hG4IXGv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yfiGxb64\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb871063-iiVRAZP0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9LnR2Z1R\">优惠券ID，调用卡券详情接口返回</p></td></tr></tbody></table></d